# Frontend

- `@/*` is `client/`. `@shared/*` is `shared/`.
- Tailwind tokens from `client/global.css`. Prefer `primary`, `muted`, `destructive`, `card`, `border`.
- Lists that can grow use `DataGrid` (`client/components/ui/data-grid.tsx`): server sort, search, pagination, and a phone card.
- Portals use `PortalShell`. Group nav items with `section`. Phones use the top bar, More sheet and bottom tabs.
- Every new string goes through `t()` and both locale files.
- `PageMeta` sets the document title.
- Log unexpected UI failures with `client/utils/logger.ts`.
- Customer-facing copy does not use an em dash.
